        "created_at": "2013-09-01T05:36:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Once Incapacitated, AZ offers the ability \"Choose a hero.&nbsp; Increase the next damage dealt by that hero by 2\" (paraphrasing from memory).&nbsp; If he chooses Tempest, and Tempest uses his Squall power to deal 1 damage to every non-hero target, that's all simultaneous right?&nbsp; So each target would take 3 damage instead?&nbsp; Or do you have to pick one of them which takes the \"first\" damage, and only that one goes up by 2?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:09.886Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
