        "id": 71886,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-09-01T19:22:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Any action from a single card or source that effects more than one thing that would seem to be simultaneous is instead resolved in the order the heroes choose, so Tempest would choose who to hit first, and that hit would be at +2 damage.</p><p>If multiple cards activate simultaneously the order is in card play order.</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:51:11.127Z",
